==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use meatshields like [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Normal tank]] to stall and upgrade your worker wallet until the Gories spawn, which then you will want to put down [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist]], while still putting down some tanks. before your cats hit their base summon [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut]] and spam all your attackers.

